<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/27/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Restricted Residence Act 1933 [Act 377] is repealed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/27/eng@> .
