<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/27/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection 2(2), on the date of coming into operation of this Act, any order issued or made under the repealed Act which is still in force on the date of coming into operation of this Act shall cease to have effect and any pending action or proceedings under the repealed Act shall be discontinued."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/27/eng@> .
